WEBVTT

00:00:03.180 --> 00:00:09.670
Explosive Shoot

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:19.800
Keep fighting chasing your dream

00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:23.130
with love, courage and friendship

00:00:23.130 --> 00:00:26.630
This Blade and I are one

00:00:26.630 --> 00:00:29.720
Spin as hard as you can until the limit

00:00:29.720 --> 00:00:32.770
BURNING SOUL

00:00:43.720 --> 00:00:46.210
The things I can't do alone

00:00:46.210 --> 00:00:50.150
are not impossible if you're with me

00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:52.980
Come with me

00:00:52.980 --> 00:00:56.310
to the ends of this world

00:00:58.080 --> 00:01:03.550
The Four Sacred Beasts are athletes of love

00:01:04.340 --> 00:01:07.120
Shine! Open your eyes!

00:01:07.120 --> 00:01:09.750
Dragoon  Dranzer  Draciel  Driger

00:01:09.750 --> 00:01:12.460
Awaken!

00:01:12.790 --> 00:01:16.070
Fly across the sky, my energy

00:01:16.070 --> 00:01:19.390
Rise up, Sacred Beast!

00:01:19.390 --> 00:01:22.840
To defeat all the enemies who stand in our way

00:01:22.840 --> 00:01:26.060
jump, bearing everyone's hopes

00:01:26.060 --> 00:01:29.080
SHINING SOUL

00:01:31.780 --> 00:01:35.390
We're at the Beyblade Super Battle Tournament!

00:01:36.400 --> 00:01:39.280
It's the start of the long-awaited second day!

00:01:39.280 --> 00:01:42.720
Today kicks off with the
second match of the semi-finals!

00:01:46.280 --> 00:01:48.870
It's a battle you can't miss!

00:01:49.380 --> 00:01:51.810
Alright! I'm going to give all I've got!

00:01:51.810 --> 00:01:53.450
Takao! Show them what you can do!

00:01:53.450 --> 00:01:54.710
Trust me, I will!

00:01:54.710 --> 00:01:59.210
The battle will start any minute
now, where is the Professor?

00:01:59.210 --> 00:02:02.890
You know, I haven't seen him around since last night.

00:02:02.890 --> 00:02:04.210
Since yesterday?

00:02:04.210 --> 00:02:09.300
Seriously, what is that Professor doing disappearing right before a battle?

00:02:10.540 --> 00:02:12.240
Last nigh, huh...

00:02:14.260 --> 00:02:16.950
Don't worry, I'm sure he will show up!

00:02:17.130 --> 00:02:19.200
The battle's about to start! Hurry up!

00:02:19.520 --> 00:02:20.310
Yeah!

00:02:32.800 --> 00:02:34.340
I need to hurry up...

00:02:45.140 --> 00:02:49.490
If the cause of those cracks is what I think it is,

00:02:49.490 --> 00:02:51.490
Takao will...

00:02:51.860 --> 00:02:52.860
lose.

00:02:53.200 --> 00:02:58.190
Roar! Dragoon Storm

00:03:02.580 --> 00:03:05.220
And now, enter the contestants!

00:03:05.220 --> 00:03:09.360
First is the semi-finalist who defeated his opponents with sharp attacks.

00:03:09.840 --> 00:03:12.180
It's Takao Kinomiya!

00:03:18.640 --> 00:03:24.160
Next, he earned his place here with his overwhelming power and flashy moves.

00:03:24.160 --> 00:03:25.390
It's Rei Kon!

00:03:38.800 --> 00:03:42.960
What's this? He doesn't look eager to do do this at all!

00:03:42.960 --> 00:03:44.790
Hey! Take this seriously!

00:03:45.220 --> 00:03:49.380
"Take this seriously"? You're going to lose if I do.

00:03:49.380 --> 00:03:50.790
What did you say?!

00:03:51.810 --> 00:03:55.260
This guy's pretty strong, you
know. Do you think you can win?

00:03:55.260 --> 00:03:59.060
Of course I do! Man, you're
really getting on my nerves!

00:03:59.450 --> 00:04:04.520
Oh, the two contestants heat up even before the match! This is going to be good!

00:04:04.880 --> 00:04:07.040
Rei looks really confident.

00:04:07.040 --> 00:04:10.690
He sure does. I wonder where
that confidence comes from...

00:04:14.530 --> 00:04:16.610
Contestants, get to the shoot points.

00:04:21.330 --> 00:04:24.130
The match will be a standard 'best out of three'.

00:04:24.130 --> 00:04:27.980
The first to win two rounds wins a spot at the finals. Who will it be?

00:04:31.920 --> 00:04:37.420
That Professor... The battle is already starting. What is he doing at a time like this?!

00:04:37.920 --> 00:04:39.670
First Battle!

00:04:39.670 --> 00:04:45.170
Even if Professor isn't here, I have Dragoon and this shoot on my side!

00:04:45.170 --> 00:04:47.920
Alright, are you ready?

00:04:48.760 --> 00:04:50.770
Here we go, then.

00:04:51.270 --> 00:04:52.070
Three!

00:04:52.680 --> 00:04:53.510
Two!

00:04:53.930 --> 00:04:54.720
One!

00:04:55.200 --> 00:04:57.050
Go... Shoot!

00:04:57.050 --> 00:04:58.180
Go, Dragoon!

00:05:11.360 --> 00:05:13.900
Oh! Dragoon vanished!

00:05:13.900 --> 00:05:17.520
How's this? You can't attack
what you can't see can you?

00:05:18.700 --> 00:05:22.010
Are you sure about that? I wouldn't let my guard down if I were you.

00:05:22.420 --> 00:05:26.740
Meanwhile, Driger sits still in the center and monitoring the situation!

00:05:26.740 --> 00:05:30.350
What's wrong? If you're not going to attack, I will!

00:05:35.350 --> 00:05:38.180
Oh! Driger bounced off and avoided flying out!

00:05:38.630 --> 00:05:39.710
I was so close!

00:05:40.100 --> 00:05:41.960
The real fight starts now.

00:05:44.070 --> 00:05:47.390
Oh..? Driger's movements have suddenly changed!

00:05:47.390 --> 00:05:48.640
What?!

00:05:48.640 --> 00:05:51.600
Driger starts running wild across the entire stadium!

00:05:51.600 --> 00:05:53.650
This is bad! Get away, Dragoon!

00:05:55.810 --> 00:05:58.940
Even if I can't see you, I still have means to attack you.

00:05:59.370 --> 00:06:00.980
Go, Driger!

00:06:07.810 --> 00:06:09.890
Now! Tiger Claw!

00:06:11.660 --> 00:06:12.550
Oh, crap!

00:06:30.060 --> 00:06:31.430
N-No way..!

00:06:36.420 --> 00:06:41.650
Incredible! Dragoon, that seemed unbeatable, has been crushed!

00:06:41.840 --> 00:06:43.150
This just goes to show the formidable power of Driger's attacks!

00:06:43.150 --> 00:06:46.600
Wow! How did he find Dragoon when he was invisible?

00:06:46.920 --> 00:06:49.670
It's thanks to those free and unbound movements.

00:06:50.140 --> 00:06:56.160
If he launches indiscriminate attacks in all directions, being invisible will be meaningless.

00:06:59.430 --> 00:07:00.810
My Dragoon...

00:07:03.250 --> 00:07:07.110
It really looks as if a tiger slashed it with its claws.

00:07:07.530 --> 00:07:09.510
How can it be so powerful..?

00:07:13.780 --> 00:07:14.870
He's strong!

00:07:18.070 --> 00:07:21.200
This match has already gotten exciting!

00:07:21.200 --> 00:07:23.460
Rei has scored the first point!

00:07:23.460 --> 00:07:26.340
I'm sure th second round will be just as inten—

00:07:26.340 --> 00:07:28.290
H-Hey! Wait, where are you going?!

00:07:29.070 --> 00:07:31.040
The battle is not over yet, Rei!

00:07:32.060 --> 00:07:37.510
It's pointless to keep fighting. The difference in power between him and me is too big.

00:07:40.270 --> 00:07:43.190
Anyway, his Beyblade is heavily damaged.

00:07:43.190 --> 00:07:47.580
I'm pretty sure the rules say you can't compete with a Beyblade you can't insert a Bit in.

00:07:47.860 --> 00:07:49.570
N-No way...

00:07:49.990 --> 00:07:54.510
He's right. You can't fight with a broken Beyblade.

00:07:54.690 --> 00:07:58.960
But if your Beyblade gets damaged during a battle, you are allowed to repair it.

00:07:58.960 --> 00:08:01.330
Takao, do you have replacement parts?

00:08:02.040 --> 00:08:02.900
Parts..?

00:08:03.600 --> 00:08:04.830
I don't...

00:08:05.860 --> 00:08:07.560
Then you leave me no choice.

00:08:08.180 --> 00:08:10.090
If you'll excuse me, I'll go take a nap.

00:08:10.550 --> 00:08:12.050
Please wait a second!

00:08:17.700 --> 00:08:18.940
Professor!

00:08:19.760 --> 00:08:21.850
I have the parts you need right here!

00:08:23.330 --> 00:08:25.890
Professor! Where did you disappear to?!

00:08:26.310 --> 00:08:29.890
Very well. Then the battle will continue after a small break.

00:08:30.360 --> 00:08:32.910
Takao, lend me your Dragoon.

00:08:32.910 --> 00:08:34.970
Here! I leave him to you!

00:08:37.500 --> 00:08:38.950
A waste of time...

00:08:40.050 --> 00:08:42.410
I knew the Professor would come!

00:08:42.410 --> 00:08:42.930
Yes.

00:08:43.890 --> 00:08:49.330
Still, even after getting repaired, will Dragoon be able to beat Driger as it is now?

00:08:49.660 --> 00:08:53.080
No! If they're together, I'm sure it will be fine!

00:08:58.720 --> 00:09:03.190
As you can see, against Driger's terrible attack power

00:09:03.730 --> 00:09:08.660
Dragoon's Attack Ring couldn't bear the impact and ended up destroyed.

00:09:08.660 --> 00:09:09.670
Yeah...

00:09:10.050 --> 00:09:17.700
To win against Driger's attack power, you need to raise yours with a higher rotational spin and attack head-on.

00:09:17.700 --> 00:09:19.120
Yeah but that's..!

00:09:19.410 --> 00:09:24.720
Indeed, if we raise your attack power and crash against him, the impact will get bigger as well,

00:09:24.720 --> 00:09:28.180
and Dragoon's Attack Ring will end up in pieces.

00:09:28.310 --> 00:09:29.380
Y-Yeah...

00:09:30.490 --> 00:09:34.290
But! This is only valid for Dragoon <i>as it is now</i>!

00:09:35.810 --> 00:09:37.650
Dragoon <i>as it is now</i>?

00:09:41.190 --> 00:09:44.490
That's why I developed this Attack Ring.

00:09:44.830 --> 00:09:45.600
This is..?

00:09:46.070 --> 00:09:48.540
I built this using new advanced materials.

00:09:48.540 --> 00:09:51.650
It's much stronger than the one you have now.

00:09:51.920 --> 00:09:55.940
With this, you shouldn't have any problem clashing head-on with Driger.

00:09:55.940 --> 00:09:59.010
Professor, don't tell me... You've been on this since last night..?

00:09:59.010 --> 00:09:59.910
Yes.

00:10:00.480 --> 00:10:06.700
But the calculations to balance it took a lot of time, and I haven't performed enough test-shoots.

00:10:07.210 --> 00:10:10.530
Will it behave as well as in my simulations, I wonder...

00:10:10.530 --> 00:10:14.790
Relax! You developed this Attack Ring, right?

00:10:15.160 --> 00:10:16.620
I'm gonna win for sure!

00:10:16.620 --> 00:10:19.050
I believe in your skills, Professor.

00:10:19.490 --> 00:10:20.530
Takao!

00:10:23.970 --> 00:10:27.730
Here. With this you will have no problems facing driger head-on.

00:10:27.920 --> 00:10:32.730
My part ends here. Everything else rests on your shoot, Takao.

00:10:32.730 --> 00:10:34.130
I know!

00:10:34.130 --> 00:10:38.690
This is the Dragoon you built,
Professor. I can't afford to lose!

00:10:41.060 --> 00:10:43.280
Let's go, Dragoon!

00:10:50.860 --> 00:10:52.820
How are you liking this tourney?

00:10:53.620 --> 00:10:56.840
It's boring. Everyone's way too weak for me.

00:10:57.030 --> 00:11:01.980
I see. Personally, I thought Takao Kinomiya showed some promise...

00:11:02.430 --> 00:11:04.840
He <i>is</i> pretty out there I guess.

00:11:05.690 --> 00:11:08.240
I need a strong Beyblader...

00:11:08.800 --> 00:11:10.310
Stronger and stronger!

00:11:13.970 --> 00:11:18.160
No need to be hasty, the tournament is far from over.

00:11:31.920 --> 00:11:36.910
Now that Takao's Dragoon is back, let's continue with the second battle!

00:11:37.410 --> 00:11:39.550
Everybody, are you ready?

00:11:41.810 --> 00:11:44.050
Rei! I'm not going to lose this time!

00:11:44.050 --> 00:11:47.520
Yeah. I'm going to go all out as well.

00:11:47.520 --> 00:11:49.590
Contestants, get to the shoot points.

00:11:53.800 --> 00:11:55.870
I'm in your hands, Dragoon.

00:11:57.920 --> 00:12:01.430
Takao, Dragoon is still incomplete.

00:12:01.430 --> 00:12:06.190
But if you give him you own power, I'm sure its abilities will extend to infinity!

00:12:07.190 --> 00:12:11.480
Look at me, Professor. Look at my shoot infused with all my might.

00:12:12.460 --> 00:12:15.040
Look at the new Dragoon's power.

00:12:18.040 --> 00:12:19.660
Here I go!

00:12:40.020 --> 00:12:42.720
He still wants to use that shoot?

00:12:42.720 --> 00:12:44.430
It's useless. He can't win with that.

00:12:44.840 --> 00:12:49.010
No! I believe in Takao and in his maximum power!

00:12:49.370 --> 00:12:50.980
Second Battle!

00:12:51.470 --> 00:12:51.950
Three!

00:12:52.480 --> 00:12:52.970
Two!

00:12:53.460 --> 00:12:53.950
One!

00:12:54.580 --> 00:12:56.020
Go... Shoot!

00:12:56.280 --> 00:12:59.330
Take this! This is my maximum power!

00:12:59.700 --> 00:13:03.810
Takao rotates his whole arm for a fierce shoot!

00:13:07.510 --> 00:13:09.760
Go! Dragoon!

00:13:14.340 --> 00:13:17.310
It's completely different from his shoot from before!

00:13:19.120 --> 00:13:22.580
I don't care how you're going to attack me, I'm going to end this right now!

00:13:26.890 --> 00:13:28.750
Tiger Claw!

00:13:32.580 --> 00:13:33.330
What?!

00:13:34.630 --> 00:13:36.340
Okay! Dragoon!

00:13:36.340 --> 00:13:38.800
Strike back with your maximum power!

00:13:48.510 --> 00:13:51.850
It's a tempest! Dragoon is generating a storm!

00:13:51.850 --> 00:13:53.810
Wow! Miracle power!

00:13:56.040 --> 00:13:57.810
Unbelievable Dragoon!

00:13:57.810 --> 00:14:01.450
He's giving rise to a storm inside the Bey Stadium!

00:14:02.910 --> 00:14:04.350
Go!

00:14:04.350 --> 00:14:06.560
Storm Attack!

00:14:11.230 --> 00:14:15.220
Driger disappears inside the storm created by Dragoon!

00:14:15.220 --> 00:14:17.040
Will he come out in one piece?

00:14:17.040 --> 00:14:20.880
You created a storm... I must
admit I wasn't expecting this.

00:14:21.070 --> 00:14:22.540
I'll go all out too then.

00:14:23.110 --> 00:14:25.550
Show them your true self, Driger!

00:14:27.220 --> 00:14:28.080
What's that..?

00:14:42.480 --> 00:14:45.040
A Sacred Beast that looks like white tiger..!

00:14:46.100 --> 00:14:50.770
Well, Takao Kinomiya? How do you like my Driger's real appearance?

00:14:51.210 --> 00:14:53.240
That's Byakko, the Sacred Beast!

00:14:56.360 --> 00:14:57.710
It's happening again!

00:14:57.710 --> 00:15:01.310
Takao, Max, Kai and now Rei!

00:15:01.620 --> 00:15:05.220
What are those phantoms that appear from Beyblades..?

00:15:05.540 --> 00:15:06.650
Rei Kon...

00:15:08.140 --> 00:15:11.680
So he, like me, was chosen by a Sacred Beast...

00:15:12.590 --> 00:15:16.720
The Sacred Beasts bestow great power upon the person they deem worthy.

00:15:16.930 --> 00:15:21.840
But sooner or later, you will
kneel before me and my Dranzer!

00:15:25.340 --> 00:15:28.840
Try and resist this! This is <i>the real</i> Tiger Claw!

00:15:33.680 --> 00:15:35.680
Endure it, Dragoon!

00:15:36.260 --> 00:15:40.070
Driger's Tiger Claw breaks loose again!

00:15:41.100 --> 00:15:44.730
Wow! Dragoon has no intention of backing down!

00:15:53.210 --> 00:15:58.280
Dragoon and Driger keep clashing violently against each other in the center of the stadium!

00:16:00.930 --> 00:16:06.720
Takao! Dragoon is an attack-type Beyblade! It will be impossible to win a battle of endurance!

00:16:06.720 --> 00:16:07.960
I know that!

00:16:08.970 --> 00:16:10.550
I know that, but...

00:16:11.370 --> 00:16:12.770
Please, Dragoon!

00:16:20.850 --> 00:16:23.200
His rotational speed is rising?!

00:16:23.200 --> 00:16:24.740
Unbelievable!

00:16:30.660 --> 00:16:33.500
Amazing! The whole stadium is shaking!

00:16:33.500 --> 00:16:36.050
And it keeps spinning faster and faster!

00:16:42.290 --> 00:16:44.060
T-This is..!

00:16:44.350 --> 00:16:47.280
Are you saying you <i>still </i>
have some power left in you?!

00:16:53.540 --> 00:16:54.600
It can't be..!

00:16:54.600 --> 00:16:58.240
The storm that had died down is rising up again?!

00:17:09.540 --> 00:17:10.770
What the..?!

00:17:10.770 --> 00:17:13.760
Go! Dragoon!

00:17:14.750 --> 00:17:16.850
I'm not going to let you do that!

00:17:19.500 --> 00:17:22.340
Storm Attack!

00:17:31.520 --> 00:17:33.940
W-Where does this power come from..?!

00:18:27.440 --> 00:18:32.800
D-Driger is out of the ring!
The winner is Takao Kinomiya!

00:18:37.730 --> 00:18:40.020
Alright! I did it!

00:18:40.610 --> 00:18:42.960
You're very strong, Takao!

00:18:43.190 --> 00:18:44.000
Hey, Max!

00:18:46.220 --> 00:18:49.180
To think he would bring out
this much power from Dragoon...

00:18:49.860 --> 00:18:53.850
Takao, you have gone way beyond my simulations.

00:18:53.850 --> 00:18:55.220
Professor!

00:18:55.220 --> 00:18:59.040
I did it, professor! It's all thanks to the Beyblade you built!

00:18:59.040 --> 00:19:03.180
No, you won because you were able to make good use of the incomplete Dragoon.

00:19:03.180 --> 00:19:05.230
Takao, you were great!

00:19:05.240 --> 00:19:07.850
Ow! What's the big idea, Max?!

00:19:07.850 --> 00:19:11.420
I was deeply moved by your
fight! you two are Miracle Boys!

00:19:11.420 --> 00:19:15.490
What, you're only seeing it
now? What took you so long?

00:19:15.810 --> 00:19:17.070
My thoughts exactly.

00:19:19.300 --> 00:19:20.850
You're heavy, Max!

00:19:20.850 --> 00:19:22.120
Why you!

00:19:27.900 --> 00:19:30.450
Byakko is... happy!

00:19:31.810 --> 00:19:33.410
Takao Kinomiya...

00:19:34.420 --> 00:19:36.480
I knew it, the world really <i>is</i> big!

00:19:37.690 --> 00:19:38.470
Takao!

00:19:43.490 --> 00:19:45.880
You got me. I lost.

00:19:46.400 --> 00:19:49.340
I had no idea people this strong existed.

00:19:52.100 --> 00:19:54.590
Takao, you are truly strong!

00:19:54.590 --> 00:19:57.280
Hey you were quite strong yourself!

00:19:57.280 --> 00:20:00.500
Quite? Are you sure you didn't mean "incredibly"?

00:20:00.500 --> 00:20:02.720
This guy..!

00:20:05.800 --> 00:20:07.380
I admit defeat. I lost.

00:20:08.360 --> 00:20:11.380
We're at one point each. The score's not settled yet!

00:20:11.730 --> 00:20:17.390
No, a final battle isn't necessary. I can't beat you as I am right now.

00:20:17.880 --> 00:20:18.490
Rei..?

00:20:19.140 --> 00:20:24.170
But I <i>will</i> get stronger! When that happens, I won't lose to you again!

00:20:25.310 --> 00:20:26.900
I'm starting to get excited!

00:20:27.390 --> 00:20:29.830
I'll be waiting for you, Takao. We'll meet again!

00:20:30.530 --> 00:20:31.910
Y-Yeah.

00:20:33.140 --> 00:20:38.220
"We'll meet again." "I'll be waiting?" Hey, Rei! What did you mean by that?

00:20:42.740 --> 00:20:43.970
What's with him?

00:20:44.360 --> 00:20:45.100
What, indeed...

00:20:50.900 --> 00:20:53.440
I didn't think you would retire.

00:20:54.190 --> 00:20:57.890
I don't fight meaningless
battles. It only gets me hungry.

00:20:58.220 --> 00:20:59.580
I am satisfied.

00:20:59.810 --> 00:21:03.370
Takao Kinomiya... He's a formidable Beyblader.

00:21:03.370 --> 00:21:04.720
Does that mean..?

00:21:04.720 --> 00:21:07.590
Yeah, I wouldn't mind teaming up with him.

00:21:10.020 --> 00:21:13.060
This is the Beyblade Super Tournament!

00:21:13.060 --> 00:21:16.820
The match-ups for the finals have been decided at last!

00:21:17.330 --> 00:21:20.810
Dragoon and his owner Takao Kinomiya?

00:21:20.810 --> 00:21:23.850
Or Dranzer and his owner Kai Hiwatari?

00:21:24.190 --> 00:21:28.770
Which one of these two will the Goddess of Victory show her smile to?

00:21:39.960 --> 00:21:44.730
Spring waves its hand smiling,

00:21:44.730 --> 00:21:50.200
Summer spreads passion.

00:21:50.200 --> 00:21:55.370
Seasons pass one after the other,

00:21:55.370 --> 00:21:59.580
Fall and Winter are good friends.

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:05.660
When there is a problem you can't solve,

00:22:05.660 --> 00:22:11.560
Trust, friendship, love and emotion

00:22:14.130 --> 00:22:18.800
Clouds keep flying across the sky,

00:22:18.800 --> 00:22:24.200
the sky keeps changing every second

00:22:24.200 --> 00:22:29.110
My eyes well up and tears stream down my face,

00:22:29.110 --> 00:22:33.110
but they're not tears of sadness

00:22:34.820 --> 00:22:39.420
I summon my courage and try to put it into words.

00:22:39.420 --> 00:22:44.770
"Let's go on a journey to the city of hope!"

00:22:44.770 --> 00:22:49.760
All your dreams will come true

00:22:57.320 --> 00:23:00.980
According to my analysis, the finals are here at last.

00:23:00.980 --> 00:23:05.730
We're up against Kai from the Shellkillers. He's surely the strongest opponent we've ever met.

00:23:05.730 --> 00:23:10.140
Takao gets cocky, and Kai
finally shows off his true power!

00:23:10.140 --> 00:23:14.860
What is he planning to do
after removing his arm protector..?

00:23:14.860 --> 00:23:19.150
Next time: Takao vs Kai, The Fated Duel.

00:23:19.540 --> 00:23:24.420
Still, those triangular marks on his cheeks are a mystery to me...
